Snix, https://git.snix.dev/snix/snix
	Revision 22ca63bdb71c221001526304eca934385fb47c26 (2026-09-24).
	GPL-3.0-only. Compiled in: the evaluator and its builtin macros, the hash,
	flake reference and compatibility crates, and parts of noxi-glue. The
	noxi-compat-derive and noxi-serde crates also derive from it.

CppNix (Nix), https://github.com/NixOS/nix
	Release 2.35.2, revision 2c73b59da29606068c0c98db015dd3a66955525d.
	LGPL-2.1-or-later. Compiled in: imported-drv-to-derivation.nix,
	primops/derivation.nix, fetchurl.nix, call-flake.nix, schema.sql,
	ca-specific-schema.sql, get-env.sh and the setting descriptions in
	config-settings.json. Copied, not compiled in: the test snapshot in
	tests/nix, whose gtest-with-params.hh is BSD-2-Clause.

Nix 2.3.16, https://github.com/NixOS/nix
	Revision 8c5b39875edb3b88f5825cc76d1cae91b3afd130 (tag 2.3.16).
	LGPL-2.1-or-later. Most language test cases in
	crates/noxi/eval/src/tests/nix_tests come from this tag through Snix;
	most of the rest match later Nix releases. They are not compiled into any
	executable.

